              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abazigu ab'abantu b'ekika kya Yuda n'ekya Benjamini baawulira ng'abantu abaava mu bunhage bwe baali bali kuzimba obuyaaka eisinzizo lya Musengwa Katonda, Katonda wa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.17.24+2KI.17.25+2KI.17.26+2KI.17.27+2KI.17.28+2KI.17.29+2KI.17.30+2KI.17.31+2KI.17.32+2KI.17.33+2KI.17.34+2KI.17.35+2KI.17.36+2KI.17.37+2KI.17.38+2KI.17.39+2KI.17.40+2KI.17.41"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakyab 17:24-41",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kale baaja ye Zerubbabeli ni y'abakulu ab'enda dha baiseibwe, baabakoba bati: “Ka tubeeyimbeku tuzimbire ghalala endhu ya Katonda kuba twena tusinza Katonda waimwe nga imwe bwe mukola, era tubairenga tughaayo emisengo y'ali okuviira irala mu biseera bya kyabazinga Esarahaddoni ow'e Assiria, eyatuleeta ghano.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
